    "updated_at": "2020-10-02T13:11:48Z",
    "body": "BTW, my solution for now is to have a config like so (just an excerpt):\r\n\r\n```toml\r\n[git_status]\r\nbehind = ' '\r\nmodified = ' ~$count'\r\nrenamed = ' $count'\r\ndeleted = ' -$count'\r\nformat = '[\\[$all_status$ahead_behind \\]]($style) '\r\n```\r\n\r\nNote that I've put a single space before every element, and also after `$ahead_behind`, so that now my prompt always is `[ c o n t e n t s ]`.",
