    "body": "I managed to figure out a solution with no spaces on the outsides using the backspace character:\r\n\r\n[git_status]\r\nbehind = ' '\r\nmodified = '~$count '\r\nrenamed = '$count '\r\ndeleted = '-$count '\r\nformat = \"\\[\\\\\\\\\\[$all_status$ahead_behind\\\\b\\\\\\\\\\]]\\($style\\) \"",
